                    TransactionType.DEPOSIT, TransactionType.TRANSFER -> MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primary
                    TransactionType.WITHDRAWAL, TransactionType.PAYMENT -> MaterialTheme.colorScheme.error
                }
            )
        }
    }
