# Offline-First Field Surveying App (Flutter/Dart)

Here's a complete implementation of an offline-first field surveying app with sync capabilities when reconnected. This uses Flutter with Hive for local storage and connectivity_plus for network detection.

## 1. First, set up `pubspec.yaml`

```yaml
name: survey_app
description: A field surveying app with offline capabilities

environment:
