Here's a complete initial implementation of a social messaging app with real-time notifications and in-app monetization using **Elixir/Phoenix** (backend) and **React/TypeScript** (frontend).

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

### 1. Backend Setup (Elixir/Phoenix)

```bash
# Install Elixir (if not already installed)
# https://elixir-lang.org/install.html

# Create new Phoenix project
mix phx.new social_messaging_app --live
cd social_messaging_app

# Install dependencies
mix deps.get

# Set up database
mix ecto.create

# Generate authentication
mix phx.gen.auth Accounts User users

# Generate models
mix phx.gen.context Messaging Message messages user_id:references content:text
mix phx.gen.context Notifications Notification notifications user_id:references message_id:references read:boolean
mix phx.gen.context Monetization Subscription subscription user_id:references plan:string status:string

# Run migrations
mix ecto.migrate

# Start Phoenix server
mix phx.server
```

