## 🔐 Authentication & Security

### Phoenix Auth Setup

1. Configure `config/config.exs`:
```elixir
config :social_messaging_app, SocialMessagingAppWeb.Endpoint,
  secret_key_base: "your-secret-key-here"
```

2. Set up JWT in `lib/social_messaging_app_web/controllers/auth_controller.ex` (generated by `phx.gen.auth`).

3. Protect routes in `router.ex`:
```elixir
pipeline :protected do
  plug :ensure_authenticated
end

scope "/api", SocialMessagingAppWeb do
  pipe_through [:api, :protected]
  post "/subscriptions", SubscriptionController, :create
end
```

