# Low-Latency Trading Platform - Initial Implementation

Below is a foundational implementation of a low-latency trading platform in C++ that can scale for future growth. This implementation focuses on core components while demonstrating architectural patterns that enable horizontal scaling.

```cpp
#include <iostream>
#include <string>
#include <vector>
#include <map>
#include <unordered_map>
