### 🔍 How It Works

| Component | Purpose |
|--------|--------|
| **AF_PACKET + TPACKET_V3** | Zero-copy packet I/O via memory-mapped ring buffer |
| **BPF Filter** | Drops non-IPv4 packets at kernel level (no user-space overhead) |
| **sendto()** | Forwards matching packets to the output interface |
| **poll()** | Efficient event loop with no busy-waiting |

