Below is a C++ implementation of an embedded sensor-processing pipeline that reads accelerometer data, preprocesses it, and detects anomalies. This example is designed to be portable across common embedded platforms (e.g., STM32, RP2040, Arduino) with minimal hardware-specific adjustments.

