# Real-Time 3D Scene Viewer with Dynamic Lighting

Here's a complete implementation of a real-time 3D scene viewer with dynamic lighting using C++ and OpenGL. This implementation includes:
- A rotating cube with Phong lighting
- Camera movement (WASD + mouse look)
- Dynamic light position
- Shader-based rendering

