### **4. Shader Files**

#### **`src/shaders/vertex_shader.glsl`**
```glsl
#version 330 core

layout (location = 0) in vec3 aPos;
layout (location = 1) in vec3 aNormal;

out vec3 FragPos;
out vec3 Normal;

