# Custom Physics Plugin for Commercial Game Engine

Below is a complete implementation of a custom physics plugin for a commercial game engine. This example uses C++ (the most recommended language) and demonstrates core physics functionality including rigid body dynamics, collision detection, and integration with a game engine's plugin system.

