## **Key Features Implemented**

| Feature | Rust Implementation | Java Implementation |
|---------|---------------------|---------------------|
| **Type Safety** | Compile-time guarantees with Rust's strong type system | Strong static typing with Java generics and validation |
| **HTTP Server** | Actix-web (async, high performance) | Spring Boot (industry standard) |
| **Validation** | `validator` crate with compile-time checks | Jakarta Validation (JSR 380) |
| **Database** | SQLx with compile-time checked queries | Spring Data JPA with Hibernate |
| **Configuration** | `config` crate with TOML support | Spring Boot `@ConfigurationProperties` |
| **Error Handling** | Custom `ServiceError` enum with `thiserror` | Custom exceptions with `@Transactional` |
| **Logging** | `env_logger` with `log` crate | Spring Boot Actuator + SLF4J |
| **Health Checks** | Custom `/health` endpoint | Spring Boot Actuator endpoints |
| **Async** | Tokio runtime | Spring WebFlux (optional) |

